      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not a gamble; it is a necessary correction to an unsustainable system that has been exploited. Small businesses that rely on cheap, unregulated labor are operating outside the established economic framework and must face the consequences of that reliance. The market will adjust, and those who cannot adapt to fair labor practices will be forced to evolve or fail, which is the natural function of a healthy, regulated economy.",
      "source": "target",
